# hausv-org dev environment: Go, Node and fish from flake.nix, so `go build`
# works in this directory without a global toolchain.
#
# .env.local is deliberately NOT sourced here: it holds JSON-valued vars
# (WEG_TENANTS_JSON, WEG_USERS_JSON) that direnv's dotenv parser can mangle.
# Load it explicitly in the command that needs it.
use flake
